---

# 27. AI Architecture Principles Summary

Every AI feature introduced into BizMate AI must comply with the following principles:

- Human Approval Before Financial Writes
- Security by Default
- Privacy by Design
- Explainable Decisions
- Confidence-Based Validation
- Rules Engine Enforcement
- Provider Independence
- Offline Resilience
- Multilingual Support
- Business Context Awareness
- Retrieval-Augmented Memory
- Auditability
- Scalability
- Accessibility

These principles are mandatory for all current and future AI functionality.
